{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51086","headline":"七言记德诗三十首谨献司徒相公 钓鱼亭 · 崔致远","name":"七言记德诗三十首谨献司徒相公 钓鱼亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"锦筵花下飞鸎鹉，罗袖风前唱《鹧鸪》。\n占得仙家诗酒兴，闲吟烟月忆蓬壶。\n（原注：伏覩相公《在郓州诗》：云：「酒满金舡花满枝，双娥齐唱《鹧鸪词》。\n」又《钓鱼亭诗》云：「水急鱼对钓，风吹柳易低。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔致远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51086.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51086","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}